  ],
  [
   32,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   33,
   "{{end-eqn}}"
  ],
  [
   34,
   ""
  ],
  [
   35,
   "Furthermore:"
  ],
  [
   36,
   ":$\\map F 1 = \\map f 1 - \\map f 1 = 0$"
  ],
  [
   37,
   ""
  ],
  [
   38,
   "The result follows from the fifth definition of the [[Definition:Exponential Function/Real/Differential Equation|exponential function]]:"
  ],
  [
   39,
   ":$\\map F x \\equiv e^x$"
